Create a reusable docket initialization helper or integrate across:
- [`applicant-review.js`](file:///c:/NBSC%20PRIME-HRM%20Intelligence%20Hub/frontend/pages/hiring/applicant-review/applicant-review.js) (Stage 1)
- [`dss-scoring.js`](file:///c:/NBSC%20PRIME-HRM%20Intelligence%20Hub/frontend/pages/hiring/dss-scoring/dss-scoring.js) (Stage 2)
- [`evaluation.js`](file:///c:/NBSC%20PRIME-HRM%20Intelligence%20Hub/frontend/pages/hiring/evaluation/evaluation.js) (Stage 3)
- [`deliberation.js`](file:///c:/NBSC%20PRIME-HRM%20Intelligence%20Hub/frontend/pages/hiring/deliberation/deliberation.js) (Stage 4)
- [`final-decision.js`](file:///c:/NBSC%20PRIME-HRM%20Intelligence%20Hub/frontend/pages/hiring/final-decision/final-decision.js) (Stage 5)

**Features**:
1. **Disambiguated Label Generator**:
   ```javascript
   function formatCandidateOption(app, vacancy) {
     const dateStr = app.created_at ? new Date(app.created_at).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' }) : 'No Date';
     const posTitle = vacancy ? vacancy.title : 'General';
     return `${app.applicant_name} • [${app.tracking_number}] • Filed: ${dateStr} • ${posTitle}`;
   }
   ```
2. **Instant Search Listener (`input-docket-search`)**:
   - Matches against `applicant_name`, `tracking_number`, `created_at` (both ISO and formatted string), and `vacancy.title`.
   - Debounced for performance.
3. **Vacancy & Stage Filter Synchronization**:
   - Filter by position and/or pipeline stage (`All Stages`, `Screening`, `DSS Scored`, `Dept Eval`, `Deliberation`, `Appointed`).
4. **Live Counter**:
   - Dynamically displays `Showing ${filtered.length} of ${allApplications.length} Applicants`.

