## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Open `applicant-review.html` in Brave browser (`file:///...`).
2. Verify the Candidate Dropdown displays: `Name • [Tracking ID] • Filed: Date • Vacancy`.
3. Test the Instant Search box:
   - Type a name fragment (e.g. `Mendoza`) -> List updates immediately to show matching applicant.
   - Type an ID fragment (e.g. `00002` or `APP-2026`) -> List filters to that specific ID.
   - Type a date (e.g. `Aug 20`) -> Filters candidates who applied on that date.
4. Test Vacancy and Stage filters:
   - Select a vacancy -> only applicants for that vacancy appear.
   - Select a stage -> only applicants in that stage appear.
5. Click between candidates and switch across pipeline stages (1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 5) to verify candidate context persists seamlessly via URL parameter `?id=app-XXX`.
